# Dr. Jishnu Mohan

> Oral & Maxillofacial Surgeon in Kochi, Kerala, India, with clinical interests in advanced implantology, TMJ disorders, orofacial pain, jaw reconstruction, facial trauma and head & neck surgical oncology. Surgeon-scientist and medical device innovator.

Dr. Jishnu Mohan treats patients in Kochi, Kerala (main clinic: Edapally) and is a consultant Head & Neck Surgical Oncologist at Homi Bhabha Cancer Hospital and Research Centre, Muzaffarpur (a Tata Memorial Centre affiliate). Trained in Oral & Maxillofacial Surgery at PGIMS Rohtak. Also works in research, patient-specific implant design and medical device innovation.

He practices across Kochi, Thrissur, and Kottayam under the brand doctorj.in.

## Clinical Services
- [TMJ Disorders](https://doctorj.in/clinical/tmj-disorders.html): jaw pain, clicking, locking — conservative and surgical treatment
- [Oral Cancer](https://doctorj.in/clinical/oral-cancer.html): screening, diagnosis, and surgical treatment
- [Dental Implants](https://doctorj.in/clinical/dental-implants.html): including patient-specific implant design
- [Facial Trauma](https://doctorj.in/clinical/facial-trauma.html): jaw, cheekbone, and soft-tissue injury
- [Orthognathic Surgery](https://doctorj.in/clinical/orthognathic-surgery.html): corrective jaw surgery
- [Jaw Reconstruction](https://doctorj.in/clinical/jaw-reconstruction.html): post-tumour, post-trauma, congenital
- [Clear Aligners](https://doctorj.in/clinical/clear-aligners.html): removable aligner treatment for suitable bite corrections
- [Snoring & Sleep Apnea](https://doctorj.in/clinical/snoring-sleep-apnea.html): non-surgical oral appliance therapy
- [Pediatric Dental Trauma](https://doctorj.in/clinical/pediatric-dental-trauma.html): emergency care for children's tooth injuries
- [Dog Bite & Animal Bite Injuries](https://doctorj.in/clinical/dog-bite-management.html): facial wound repair and infection prevention
- [Wisdom Tooth Removal](https://doctorj.in/clinical/wisdom-tooth-removal.html): simple and impacted extraction, needle-free anesthesia option available

